361 0 obj
<</A 386 0 R /AP<</N 5145 0 R >>/DA(/HeBo 12 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Btn/Ff 65536/MK<</IF<<>>/TP 1>>/P 1 0 R /Rect[ 423.965 508.53201 561.13 617.97498]/Subtype/Widget/T(Faction Symbol Image)/Type/Annot>>
endobj
362 0 obj
<</AP<</N 5652 0 R >>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK 387 0 R /P 1 0 R /Q 0/Rect[ 225 442.07999 400.64801 660.82599]/StructParent 115/Subtype/Widget/T(Allies)/Type/Annot/V(Eldritch Invocations:\r\n\r\n-Agonizing Blast \(5.5e\)\r\nSource: Player's Handbook\r\nPrerequisite: eldritch blast cantrip\r\n\r\nWhen you cast eldritch blast, add your Charisma modifier to the damage it deals on a hit. \(+5\)\r\n\r\n-Fiendish Vigor\(PHB 5.5e\)\r\nYou can cast False Life on yourself without expending a spell slot. \r\n\r\nWhen you cast the spell with this feature, you don't roll the die for the Temporary Hit Points; you automatically get the highest number on the die.\r\n\r\n-Swimmer\(Rattkin\)\r\nYour swim speed is equal to your movement speed.)>>
endobj
363 0 obj
<</AP<</N 5151 0 R >>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8388608/MK 388 0 R /P 1 0 R /Q 1/Rect[ 423.20901 622.69598 561.23999 638.53601]/StructParent 116/Subtype/Widget/T(FactionName)/Type/Annot/V()>>
endobj
364 0 obj
<</AP<</N 5653 0 R >>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK 380 0 R /P 1 0 R /Q 0/Rect[ 34.779999 36.720001 199.22 406.79999]/StructParent 119/Subtype/Widget/T(Backstory)/Type/Annot/V(-Warlock Spells, +Hexblade \r\nC: EldritchBlast, Minor Illusion\r\n1: Hex, Comprehend Languages, Wrathful Smite, Shield\r\n2: Invisibility\r\n\r\n-Bard Spells\r\nC: Mage Hand, Viscous Mockery\r\n1: HealingWord,SilveryBarbs, Tasha'sLaughter, DetectMagic\r\n___________________________\r\n\r\nCloak of the Manta Ray\r\nSource: Dungeon Master's Guide\r\n\r\nWondrous Item, Uncommon \(Requires Attunement\)\r\n\r\nWhile wearing this cloak, you can breathe underwater, and you have a Swim Speed of 60 feet\r\n\r\nhttps://claude.ai/public/artifacts/c8fac126-3e3b-4324-aa28-8c5b00c26ceb  \r\n\(race mechanics\)\r\n\r\nhttps://claude.ai/public/artifacts/fd900a1b-51b4-4fbc-93f5-dc68565d9f8e  \r\n\(race lore\)\r\n\r\nhttps://claude.ai/public/artifacts/b5c65b2f-b6fd-4b61-a507-c7652bc73cae  \(summary of quiz\))>>
endobj
365 0 obj
<</AP<</N 5648 0 R >>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK 381 0 R /P 1 0 R /Q 0/Rect[ 223.78 212.39999 577.44 416.88]/StructParent 118/Subtype/Widget/T(Feat+Traits)/Type/Annot/V(Perrin has only a few things in this life that he is truly dedicated to; Family, Coin, the Sea and most importantly... Fish.\r\n\r\nAfter years of learning the craft of merchants and swindlers from his mentors, then a few more amassing the capital and the connections to do so, he outfitted a fishing vessel with the best rigging, nets and crew he could muster. He spent the next year of his life in absolute bliss, eating fish every day, making heaps of coin and bringing both back to his beloved family.\r\n\r\nUntil one day, when Perrin caught something much larger than what he was looking for. To his horror, a giant ocean creature came to snack on his haul of fish and in doing so, ripped the vessel apart, sinking it in the process. He managed to make the long swim back to the closest shore and survive the ordeal.\r\n                      V  \(Continued Below\)  V)>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<</AP<</N 5643 0 R >>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK 382 0 R /P 1 0 R /Q 0/Rect[ 223.78 36.720001 577.44 189]/StructParent 120/Subtype/Widget/T(Treasure)/Type/Annot/V(Grief stricken and traumatized by the loss of not just his livelyhood, but his pride and joy, he spent weeks on the shore, begging for an answer... for a sign to go on.\r\nFrom deep below, far deeper in the open oceans, beyond the creature that brought this upon him, a voice answered him. It gave him the power to smite the destructive creatures of the deep. To the voice, they are parasitic invaders.\r\nThe otherwordly voice is named Auralis, patron of the deep sea. The connection grows stronger when sea water is present.\r\n\r\nFrom that day he ventured forth, seeking to build a crew, obtain a ship, and rid the Maw of such \(a\) havok-inducing monstrosity\(ies\).\r\n\r\n....Then probably just go back to selling fish and making money for his family.)>>
endobj
